            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[NUPHY-RELEASE-NOTES 1
version:1.2.56
[zh-CN]
NuPhy Lab 1.2.56

• 键盘口袋显示文件夹传输缓存占用的硬盘空间。重复复制同一个未改动的文件夹会复用已有 ZIP。
• Lab 在启动、唤醒和运行期间每小时检查过期传输。槽位、撤销记录或智能剪贴板历史仍在使用的 ZIP 会保留。
[en]
NuPhy Lab 1.2.56

• Keyboard Pocket shows the disk space used by temporary folder transfers. Copying the same unchanged folder again reuses its ZIP.
• Lab checks for unused transfers at startup, on wake and hourly while running. ZIPs used by slots, Undo or Smart Clipboard history remain available.
]]></description>
